.
.  Generate a dex interaction effects matrix
.
dimension 25 variables
device 1 x11
pre-erase off
erase
set ipl1na dexsc1.ps
device 2 postscript
device 1 font simplex
.
SKIP 50
read JAHANMI2.DAT run lab bar set y x1 to x8 batch
let y1 = y
let y2 = y
retain y1 subset batch 1
retain y2 subset batch 2
skip 0
.
. Generate Matrix of Dex Interaction Effects
.
multiplot corner coordinates 10 5 95 95
retain y x1 x2 x3 subset batch = 1
tic label size 7
label size 7
ylabel displacement 15
ylimits 350 850
char x
char size 4
line blank
tic offset units screen
tic offset 10 10
.
set matrix plot type dex interactions
. set matrix plot lower diagonal off
. set matrix plot corr on
.
scatter plot matrix y x1 x2 x3 subset batch = 1
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv DEXSC1.PS dexsc1.ps
quit
